    "type": "Quote of the Week",
    "quote": "I believe there's an inner power that makes winners or losers.",
    "author": "And the winners are the ones who really listen to the truth of their hearts.\" Sylvester Stallone (born 06 July 1946) - American actor, painter and filmmaker."
